 The Mission
 We offer our customers an online application process for a business loan. Depending on the customer's profile and need, it is directed to the right delivery model. At this moment we currently have two models in scope: Instant lending (end-to-end online loan) or Fast Track lending (Online application, but offline assessment for a loan).
 Your Day To Day
Writing Java code (17 or higher);
Design and develop high-volume, low-latency applications for mission-critical systems, delivering high-availability and performance 
Code review, knowledge sharing, testing;
Investigate and give resolutions for defects (in test, acceptance or production environments);
Prepare and participate in releases of software components using the automated CI/CD pipelines;
Grow novice engineers.
 What You'll Bring To The Team
You hold a University/Master degree in Information Technology 
Over 5 years experience in domain;
Relevant experience designing Java based backend applications using following technologies, tooling, frameworks: Java EE, Spring, SpringBoot, Cassandra, Oracle or other DB technologies;
Experience with Kotlin and/or other JVM languages is considered a plus;
Experience with Kafka, Tomcat is considered a plus;
Familiar with CI & CD, code quality (Azure DevOps, Gitlab, Jenkins, Artifactory, Ansible);
Experience in working using the Agile methodology;
Excellent written and spoken knowledge of English.
 Nice To Have
Experience in application and system security;
Experience in network components and infrastructure;
Having experience in financial application development.
